 "hook": "Giorgio Comai’s “text as data & data in the text” project “aims at facilitating structured analysis of on-line contents related to conflicts in the post-Soviet space by providing easier access to relevant datasets and tools.” Those datasets include the URL, title, text, date, and other metadata of all posts published on the Kremlin’s English-language website since the year 2000; on the Kremlin’s Russian-language website; and by Zavtra since late 1996.",
